{
  "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang",
  "chapter": 4,
  "act": 4,
  "scene": "zhaoyang",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "tangjian"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "在已定身份下，由她自己决定名字或领回私物",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l1",
      "who": "tiji",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "册命已经收起，案上另铺了一张纸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "交接后的第五日，殿门只开半边，冷气沿着席边进来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l3",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "旧笔与私物都点清了；公家收走的是差牌，没有把你那方帕子也算进去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "笔给我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l5",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你拢住笔杆，掌上裂口抵着木头，比入宫那日浅了些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l6",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "名字还要由你亲口说；这一页不替你写想要什么，也不替旁人替你答应。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "册命已成。新名这一处，昨日没有替你补。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这名字，我再看一眼。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你蘸过笔，没有立刻落到册上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（天。也可以是曌。还可以……就留着。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.enthroned": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "怎么写，都照你落的这一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的名字没有待补。东西领回就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.declined_crown": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。今日仍有公议，去听不等于领差。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "议件也给我。我仍署自己的名字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_won": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "本人的存件在这，不和受位的册子合装。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s01_zhaoyang.l16",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把素帕压回袖底，留笔在手里。"
    }
  ],
